.deploy-worktree/

# Android signing material and store packages. The PWABuilder zip contains
# signing.keystore plus signing-key-info.txt (its passwords) — losing that key
# means never being able to update the Play listing again, and publishing it
# means anyone can sign as you. This repo pushes to a public remote: never
# commit any of it. Keep the zip backed up somewhere outside the working tree.
*.zip
*.keystore
*.jks
*.aab
*.apk
signing-key-info.txt
